  {
   "n": 1,
   "text": "Loom, Notion and Calendly have free twins!",
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 2.52
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "text": "Six apps, seventy-five bucks a month. Watch it hit zero!",
   "start": 2.67,
   "end": 5.59
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "text": "The last one is insane. Stay for it.",
   "start": 5.74,
   "end": 7.76
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "text": "Loom makes screen videos. Cap does it free.",
   "start": 7.91,
   "end": 10.37
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "text": "Notion? AppFlowy. Notes, docs, even AI.",
   "start": 10.52,
   "end": 13.58
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "text": "Calendly? Cal D I Y, for personal use only.",
   "start": 13.73,
   "end": 16.89
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "text": "Intercom bills per seat, and per AI reply.",
   "start": 17.04,
   "end": 19.52
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "text": "Chatwoot is free if you host it.",
   "start": 19.67,
   "end": 21.77
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "text": "Wispr Flow? OpenWhispr. You talk, it types.",
   "start": 21.92,
   "end": 24.52
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "text": "And the big one, ElevenLabs.",
   "start": 24.67,
   "end": 26.59
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "text": "VoiceStudio clones your own voice, on your own machine.",
   "start": 26.74,
   "end": 29.5
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "text": "It's new, just seven months old.",
   "start": 29.65,
   "end": 31.48
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "text": "We did not test these, so check each one yourself.",
   "start": 31.63,
   "end": 33.87
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "text": "Save the list. Send it to a friend who pays for Loom.",
   "start": 34.02,
   "end": 36.52
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "text": "The setup's in the link in bio.",
   "start": 36.67,
   "end": 38.48
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "text": "Want the next one? Follow, and you'll see it.",
